danselerap8","putrajaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"An open air and spacious food court catering to the residents of the community and government staff offering mostly local dishes at a fairly cheap price. You can also try the western menu at Harris's Bistro on the upper level of the food court. At RM 9 for a plate of chicken with black pepper or barbecue sauce and served with fries and coleslaw, it is enough to satisfy your hunger pangs. Harris's ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Putrajaya"},{"id":"putrajaya_wv_night_market","areaId":"putrajaya","name":"Night Market","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":2.9263,"lng":101.6871},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"putrajaya_wv_night_market","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["nightmarket","putrajaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Every Tuesday and Friday there is a nice night market with aisles of fresh foods, prepared foods, and household goods. Like Putrajaya itself, it is slightly less multi-cultural than many Malaysian night markets. Prepared food ranges from RM 1 to 10. Fried mushrooms are a must try with many different seasonings available.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Putrajaya"},{"id":"putrajaya_wv_taman_warisan","areaId":"putrajaya","name":"Taman Warisan","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":2.92797,"lng":101.70044},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"